hardcore #skel, he's
always hardcore that's part

00:08:26.299 --> 00:08:28.852
of why we love Stephen Kelly so much,

00:08:28.852 --> 00:08:31.556
you're gettin' a lot of
love here in the chat.

00:08:31.556 --> 00:08:32.962
I want to get to some questions,

00:08:32.962 --> 00:08:35.048
I mean we do this every month for you guys

00:08:35.048 --> 00:08:37.964
to help you out and get you
past whatever limitations

00:08:37.964 --> 00:08:39.578
you're facing right now.

00:08:39.578 --> 00:08:40.913
So for those of you who
have questions leave it

00:08:40.913 --> 00:08:43.845
