- I'm readin' a book at the moment,

00:52:45.418 --> 00:52:47.233
there's loads of great books wow,

00:52:47.233 --> 00:52:49.821
your book obviously
Evan that's a must read.

00:52:49.821 --> 00:52:51.331
(laughs)

00:52:51.331 --> 00:52:54.901
Big plug Evan's book
