00:55:35.124 --> 00:55:37.421
you're not selling shoes,
you're not selling software,

00:55:37.421 --> 00:55:38.855
you're selling an experience

00:55:38.855 --> 00:55:41.361
and tryin' to give the
best possible experience

00:55:41.361 --> 00:55:43.690
to your customers in every scenario

00:55:43.690 --> 00:55:45.280
so they have an emotional connection

00:55:45.280 --> 00:55:48.313
to your business beyond just the benefits

00:55:48.313 --> 00:55:50.942
they get from using your product.

00:55:50.942 --> 00:55:51.775
It's a great book.

00:55:51.775 --> 00:55:54.842
I don't know how much
it relates to confidence

00:55:54.842 --> 00:55:58.429
to be your true self which is this theme

00:55:58.429 --> 00:56:00.362
so I just started a
