00:56:05.031 --> 00:56:07.240
that hold you back,

00:56:07.240 --> 00:56:10.188
that when you want to
go and do something big

00:56:10.188 --> 00:56:11.939
and then you self sabotage somehow,

00:56:11.939 --> 00:56:14.245
what are those triggers that
then if you identify them,

00:56:14.245 --> 00:56:16.400
you can change your behavior.

00:56:16.400 --> 00:56:17.472
I'm just starting that

00:56:17.472 --> 00:56:18.307
which is interesting,

00:56:18.307 --> 00:56:20.681
but I recommend checkin'
that out for you guys

00:56:20.681 --> 00:56:24.620
